  "native_kbm_note": "No source confirms keyboard/mouse on PS5. Rebellion's accessibility page mentions KBM bindings without naming platforms, and no console guide mentions KBM. Believed to be controller-only; unconfirmed.",
  "ads_pct": 100,
  "confidence": "medium",
  "notes": "PS5 (Classic layout): hyperx, outsidergaming and samurai-gamers agree. PC: defkey and samurai-gamers. Both are community lists, and both list LCtrl for crouch and also for aim toggle, and C for crouch, prone, pacify and carry, so C is used as primary crouch/prone (tap/hold Circle). Empty Lung on PC is Space while aiming; on PS5 it is L3 (or R1) while scoped, so LShift (L3) gives empty lung when scoped and Space only vaults. Swap shoulder: PC middle click (gamertweak), PS5 hold Triangle (outsidergaming). Mouse wheel zoom maps to D-pad Up/Down, which outside the scope also equips the rifle / tags. Pacify (Square during takedown), ammo quick-switch (G) and items 4-0 are not mapped. PC Esc for pause is assumed (standard).",
